# UI organization

As the app grows, **split large UI** instead of growing single files.

## Where code lives

| Kind | Location |
|------|----------|
| Route screens | `src/pages/` (and `src/pages/admin/` for admin) |
| Reusable widgets | `src/components/` |
| Product chrome | `AppLayout`, `HubTopBar`, `BottomNav`, `AppFooter`, `MobileNavDrawer` |
| Feature-specific logic + UI | `src/features/<feature>/` (e.g. `settings/`, `session-detail/`) |
| Product design-system primitives | `src/components/app-ui/` |
| Admin / shadcn primitives | `src/components/ui/` |
| Nav / footer / account links | `src/config/navigation.ts` |

## Practices

- Avoid deep JSX trees in `pages/*`; extract sections into co-located `pages/<slug>/` folders, `components/`, or `features/`.
- Co-locate hooks and small presentational pieces with the feature (`features/settings/hooks/`, etc.).
- Prefer **one route component per file** in `pages/`.
- Use `cn()` from `@/lib/utils` for conditional Tailwind classes.
- **Product theme:** `.apex-theme` + `--apex-*` / Tailwind `apex-*` utilities via `src/styles/theme.css` (keep scoped; do not merge into Admin/shadcn unprefixed tokens).
- **Admin theme:** `src/global.css` semantic tokens only — do not apply `apex-*` product classes in Admin.

## Routing

- Register new **product** paths in the `AppShell` tree in `src/App.tsx` **above** the `*` NotFound route, wrapped in `AppLayout` with top/bottom bars as needed.
- Use unprefixed URLs (`/sessions`, `/upload`). Do not add `/v2` routes or legacy path aliases (`/activity/:id`, etc.).
- Use `ProtectedRoute`, `GuestOnlyRoute`, or `AdminRoute` from `src/auth/` when access control applies.
- Admin routes stay under `/admin/*` with `AdminLayout`.

## Do not

- Reintroduce a `client/` subdirectory—`@/` maps to `src/`.
- Reintroduce `pages/v2/`, `components/v2/`, or `*V2` filename suffixes.
- Add Express or local `/api` handlers in this repo; call the Fastify backend via `@/lib/api`.
